.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-hash 1  "hash " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-hash \- Print the snapshot\-naming digest of a Message\-ID
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc hash\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the snapshot\-naming digest of a Message\-ID
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Message\-ID (surrounding angle brackets optional)
